<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_pages">pp. 8018–8027</span>.
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S2.SS3.p1.1" title="2.3 Evaluation for Text-to-Image Generation ‣ 2 Related Work ‣ Guidance Matters: Rethinking the Evaluation Pitfall for Text-to-Image Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2.3</span></a>.
</span></li>
<li id="bib.bib50" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_inproceedings"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_author-year ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhou <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span> (2025)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">Z. Zhou, S. Shao, L. Bai, S. Zhang, Z. Xu, B. Han, and Z. Xie</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title">Golden noise for diffusion models: a learning framework</span>.
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_inbook">Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision</span>,
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_pages">pp. 17688–17697</span>.
</span>
