</figure>
<figure id="A3.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.22570v1/curvature.png" id="A3.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:295/236;" width="295" height="236" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>TDG vs. CFG in manifold space. Compared to CFG, TDG enlarges the search space to a hyperplane.
</figcaption>
</figure>
