<span id="A4.F11.2.1.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.F11.2.1.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">HPS v2: 30.7722</span></span></span>
</span>
</span></span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="A4.F11.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">Prompt: <span id="A4.F11.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">“A cat, chubby, very fine wispy and extremely long swirly wavy fur, under water, Kuniyoshi Utagawa, Hishida Shuns.”
<br class="ltx_break">
<span id="A4.F11.3.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><img src="2602.22570v1/fig/large_w/38_w=5.5.png" id="A4.F11.g5" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:126/126;" width="126" height="126" alt="Refer to caption"></span>
<span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><img src="2602.22570v1/fig/large_w/38_w=10.png" id="A4.F11.g6" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:126/126;" width="126" height="126" alt="Refer to caption"></span>
<span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><img src="2602.22570v1/fig/large_w/38_w=15.png" id="A4.F11.g7" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:126/126;" width="126" height="126" alt="Refer to caption"></span>
<span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><img src="2602.22570v1/fig/large_w/38_w=20.png" id="A4.F11.g8" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:126/126;" width="126" height="126" alt="Refer to caption"></span></span>
<span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">HPS v2: 28.6557</span></span>
<span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">HPS v2: 29.2244</span></span>
<span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.F11.3.1.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">HPS v2: 29.6573</span></span>
