<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>The HPS v2 scores of generated images under different CFG scales <math id="A4.F11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega\in\{5.5,10,15,20\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>5.5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega\in\{5.5,10,15,20\}</annotation></semantics></math>, respectively. Model: Stable Diffusion-XL. HPSv2 exhibit a strong bias to large CFG scales in a wide range, even if generation quality starts to degrade due to too strong guidance.</figcaption>
